# Publish this app

After a requested change to this backup app, commit it, push it to origin, and install that commit on the test server. Do this without waiting to be asked again.

- Commit as the repo's existing local author. Do not change git config.
- Do not commit secrets, `__pycache__`, or `dist/`.
- The test server is `immich@192.168.0.51`. Install from the pushed commit with `sudo python3 install.py`. The installer must not overwrite `/etc/immich-backup/config.ini`.
- Restart `immich-backup-status.service` so the page loads the new code. Do not restart `immich-backup.service`, and do not start a backup.
- Do not change the live Immich machine at `192.168.0.182`, the Proxmox host, or the real photo and backup disks.
